<h3><u>Garm reti pe mai</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Haay asr ka waqt hai</p>

<p>Shabbir ki aati hai sada</p>

<p>1. Chur zakhmo se badan hogaya ama mera</p>

<p>Apani agosh me ab mujko chupalo ama</p>

<p>Are dhoop hai apni aba aan ke dalo ama</p>

<p>(Garm reti pa me gir ta hu sambhalo ama)x2</p>

<p>2. Thak gayaa lash utha kar me bhare lashkar ki</p>

<p>Laash qasim ki me laya hu kabhi akber ki</p>

<p>Khud baniyi he lahad me ne ali asger</p>

<p>Do tasali muje sine se lagalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>

<p>3. Teer talwar se, khanjar se badan zakhmi hai</p>

<p>Khaak jalti hai to zakhmo chubhan hoti hai</p>

<p>Mere zakhmo se mere dil ka lahu jari hai</p>

<p>Apni chadar ko mere zakhm pe dalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>

<p>4. Mera abbas khafa hogaya amma moojse</p>

<p>Wo nahi aaya utha laya tha bazu uske</p>

<p>Aap ek kaam kare nehre kanare jaake</p>

<p>Mere ruthe huwe bhayi ko manaalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;.</p>

<p>5. Chakiya pisi hai godi me bithakar mujko</p>

<p>Jaag ti rehti thi zaanu pe sula kar mujko</p>

<p>Loriya detithi Jule me jula kar mujko</p>

<p>Ek dafa god me phir apni sulalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>

<p>6. Aur kuch der ka mehmaan hu tum paas raho</p>

<p>Ret zakhmo me hai aachal se usey saaf karo</p>

<p>Aati hai rone ki aawaz sakina dekho</p>

<p>Jaawo tum jaake sakina ko sambhalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>

<p>7. Dekh wo aag lagi shame ghariba aayi</p>

<p>Dekho gabra ke nikal aayi meri ma jaayi</p>

<p>Dekho behoosh sakina ka para hai bhayi</p>

<p>Jawo sajad ko sholo se nikalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>

<p>8. Hai ghuzarish meri tumse abitni madar</p>

<p>Ama baba ki kasam dhamp lo moo par chadar</p>

<p>Dekh jayenga na ab tumse ye khooni manzar</p>

<p>Apni hota ho nighaho ko hataalo ama</p>

<p>Garm reti&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>

<p>Hogi jab hashr ke maidan mai majlis barpa<br />
Farsh-e-gham shay ka bechay-engi Janab-e-Zehra Ayegi Hazarath-e-Sabbir ki REHAN Sada<br />
Aaj ji khool ke tum ashk baha loo ama Garm reti pa me girta hu sambhalo ama (2)</p>
</p>